    <h2>Article 2 — App Features</h2>
    <p>
      The App allows users to draw handwritten overlays on live camera footage in real time, then capture and save photos, videos, GIFs, and similar content.
    </p>
    <p>The App provides the following main features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Real-time handwritten overlay drawing on camera footage</li>
      <li>Drawing with pen, soft chalk, and chalk tools</li>
      <li>Adjustable stroke width</li>
      <li>Photo capture and saving to the photo library</li>
      <li>Front and rear camera switching</li>
      <li>Pinch zoom</li>
      <li>Flash for photo capture</li>
      <li>Standard mode and Retro mode (LoFi) switching</li>
      <li>Date stamp embedding</li>
      <li>Video and GIF capture</li>
      <li>Pro features via in-app purchase</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Article 3 — Free Plan</h2>
    <p>
      The App offers a Free plan available at no cost.
    </p>
    <p>The Free plan has the following limitations:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>The color palette is limited to 5 basic colors (white, black, red, blue, yellow).</li>
      <li>Video and GIF capture is limited to 3 times per day.</li>
      <li>A KakuCam stamp is displayed on captured content.</li>
      <li>The KakuCam stamp cannot be hidden.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      The daily limit for video and GIF captures resets when the date changes.
    </p>

    <h2>Article 4 — Pro Plan</h2>
    <p>
      The App offers "KakuCam Pro" (the "Pro Plan") via in-app purchase.
    </p>
    <p>The Pro Plan provides the following features:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Full color picker with 16.77 million colors</li>
      <li>Unlimited video and GIF captures (no daily limit)</li>
      <li>Option to hide the KakuCam stamp</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      The Pro Plan is a one-time purchase. It is not a subscription.
    </p>

