      <li>Price: As set in App Store Connect. Price may vary by region, exchange rate, taxes, and Apple's pricing configuration.</li>
      <li>Purchase Method: Via Apple App Store</li>
      <li>Restoring Purchase: Available via the "Restore Purchase" button in the App</li>
